'''Takuya & Yuki '''is a Rare Cat added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event|Battle Cats and Shoumetsu Toshi]], this unit is a treasure drop in Shoumetsu Toshi collaboration stages. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]] increases their health and grants them the [[Money Up]] ability.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 179
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Takuya & Yuki
|name2 = Takuya, Yuki & Cat
|name3 = Takuya & Lovely Yuki
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Takuya, Yuki & Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Takuya & Lovely Yuki''' when obtained from [[Takuya & Yuki Awaken]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is similar to [[Gold Brick Cat (Special Cat)|Gold Brick Cat]], only with more health, speed and recharge time. Outside of [[Empire of Cats]], you are only going to be using them in stages with large amounts of [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating enemies]], as its high cost and long cooldown makes it inferior compared to the likes of Erasers, reaching only 38,250 HP versus Floating at level 30 (assuming all Sky Fruit Treasures are maxed), which is reduced to 19,125 if its two knockbacks are factored in.

==='''True Form'''===
The most notable gain of this True Form is a health boost that finally allows them to match Erasers, as it goes up to a whopping '''51,000''' (25,500 per knockback) at level 30. Even with the knockback hindering its utility, it can tank almost as much as a level 50 Manic Eraser/level 20+90 Eraser (25,545/26,700). At level 50, its health goes up to a monstrous '''81,000''' (40,500 per knockback), yet it moves faster than both variants. This greatly improves the unit's matchups versus its targeted trait, while Research Combos can help circumvent its long recharge time.

On the other hand, Money Up isn't so useful, as Takuya & Lovely Yuki deal negligible damage and cannot hope to kill anything on their own.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

